## Winfred Quek — Q3 2026 OKRs (Jul–Sep 2026)

---

### Objective 1: Build a consistent, qualified inbound pipeline

**KR1.1** — 40 qualified inbound leads (HDB upgraders, restructuring couples, expats, investors) logged in clients.db with ICP segment tag and source attribution by 30 Sep 2026.

**KR1.2** — 12 of those 40 leads convert to a booked 30-min strategy call (30% call-conversion rate) by 30 Sep 2026, measured via Calendly.

**KR1.3** — 2 new referral channels activated (family office network, past-client programme, or co-broke pipeline) contributing a combined 8 attributed leads by 30 Sep 2026.

---

### Objective 2: Establish Winfred Quek as the go-to voice for SG property decisions

**KR2.1** — 48 pieces of original content published across LinkedIn, WhatsApp, Instagram, and newsletter by 30 Sep 2026 (min. 4/week, no platform dark 5+ consecutive days).

**KR2.2** — Telegram channel (winwithwinfred) to 500 subscribers; LinkedIn to 2,000 followers by 30 Sep 2026.

**KR2.3** — 3 content-sourced leads logged in clients.db ("saw your post/newsletter/Telegram") by 30 Sep 2026, validating content as a pipeline contributor.

---

### Objective 3: Run a stable, low-noise automation stack

**KR3.1** — Unplanned manual interventions on the stack reduced to fewer than 5/month by 30 Sep 2026 (baseline set in July).

**KR3.2** — 95% weekly uptime on three critical pipelines (WA pretriage-to-approval, @Maddieprop_bot daily posts, AI audit delivery) across all 13 Q3 weeks, logged via health-check cron.

**KR3.3** — launchd audit complete by 31 Jul 2026: active plists reduced to ≤200, each with a named owner (skill or workflow), orphaned crons eliminated.

---

**Review cadence:** Weekly Friday review. Full retrospective first week of October 2026.

The KR thresholds (40 leads, 30% call-conversion, 500 Telegram subs, <5 manual interventions/month) were sized for a solo practice with AI leverage — ambitious but trackable. The launchd audit (KR3.3) has an early July deadline so it unblocks stack reliability for the rest of the quarter.


